# Sega CD / Mega CD release with its own panel (segacd_panel.cpp): a new
# game lands in the throne room (screen 1678 over 1744; the panel from files
# 5 and 30 in the palace's bronze; SEE DUNE MAP and DUKE LETO ATREIDES in the
# command box; the pad shows the open exits); the pad's up arrow walks to
# room 9 (screen 1680); the developer key M travels to the next location
# (the Harkonnen palace is not on the map at the start): its first room
# (screen 1714). The map itself is checked by segacd-map. Data: the bin/cue rip.
wait 1500
checkpoint segacd-panel-throne
move 276 190
click left 276 190
wait 1000
checkpoint segacd-panel-walk
key m
wait 1000
checkpoint segacd-panel-travel
quit
